{"suttaId":"thi-ap7","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[6719,6750],"vripara":"60"},"segments":{"thi-ap7:0.3":"Kaṭacchubhikkhādāyikātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap7:1.1":"“Piṇḍacāraṃ carantassa, tissanāmassa satthuno;","thi-ap7:1.3":"Kaṭacchubhikkhaṃ paggayha, buddhaseṭṭhassa dāsahaṃ.","thi-ap7:2.1":"“Paṭiggahetvā sambuddho, tisso lokagganāyako;","thi-ap7:2.3":"Vīthiyā saṇṭhito satthā, akā me anumodanaṃ.","thi-ap7:3.1":"“‘Kaṭacchubhikkhaṃ datvāna, tāvatiṃsaṃ gamissasi;","thi-ap7:3.3":"Chattiṃsadevarājūnaṃ, mahesittaṃ karissasi.","thi-ap7:4.1":"“‘Paññāsaṃ cakkavattīnaṃ, mahesittaṃ karissasi;","thi-ap7:4.3":"Manasā patthitaṃ sabbaṃ, paṭilacchasi sabbadā.","thi-ap7:5.1":"“‘Sampattiṃ anubhotvāna, pabbajissasikiñcanā;","thi-ap7:5.3":"Sabbāsave pariññāya, nibbāyissasināsavā’.","thi-ap7:6.1":"“Idaṃ vatvāna sambuddho, tisso lokagganāyako;","thi-ap7:6.3":"Nabhaṃ abbhuggamī vīro, haṃsarājāva ambare.","thi-ap7:7.1":"“Sudinnaṃ me dānavaraṃ [sudinnameva me dānaṃ (syā.)], suyiṭṭhā yāgasampadā;","thi-ap7:7.3":"Kaṭacchubhikkhaṃ datvāna, pattāhaṃ acalaṃ padaṃ.","thi-ap7:8.1":"“Dvenavute ito kappe, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","thi-ap7:8.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, bhikkhādānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap7:9.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap7:10.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap7:11.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap7:12.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ kaṭacchubhikkhādāyikā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap7:13.1":"Kaṭacchubhikkhādāyikātheriyāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
